msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates **defect migration** calculations using the "
"Nudged Elastic Band (NEB) method. NEB finds minimum energy paths (MEPs) "
"and transition states for atomic migration, diffusion, and reaction "
"pathways. These calculations are essential for understanding ion "
"conductivity, catalytic reactions, and defect dynamics."
